+# Chat Image Thumbnail Unification Implementation Plan
+
+> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.
+
+**Goal:** 把聊天域图片缩略图统一收口到单一 render owner，消除消息图区与上传预览区的重复比例/裁剪逻辑。
+
+**Architecture:** `display_blocks.blocks` 和 `message.content(blocks)` 继续作为最终展示 owner；前端新增 `ChatImageThumbnail` 作为统一缩略图组件，`AssistantContentBlocks`、`MarkdownText`、`MultimodalPreview` 全部改为复用它。消息图区使用等比缩放，上传预览区使用固定框 + `object-contain`。
+
+**Tech Stack:** Next.js 15, React 19, TypeScript, `next/image`, Playwright, ESLint
+
+---
+
+### Task 1: 冻结统一图片组件 contract
+
+**Files:**
+- Create: `web/src/components/chat/media/ChatImageThumbnail.tsx`
+- Modify: `docs/开发文档/架构设计/前端架构.md`
+- Modify: `memory-bank.md`
+
+**Step 1: 写清组件 contract**
+
+- props 至少包含：`src`、`alt`、`preset`、`className`、`removable`、`onRemove`
+- `preset` 仅允许：`message`、`composer-sm`、`composer-md`、`composer-lg`
+- `message` 负责等比缩放 + lightbox；`composer-*` 负责固定框 + `object-contain`
+
+**Step 2: 校验 contract 不扩散到协议层**
+
+Run: `rg -n "display_blocks|message.content|ChatImageThumbnail" docs/开发文档/架构设计/前端架构.md memory-bank.md`
+Expected: 文档明确 `ChatImageThumbnail` 只是 render owner，不改消息协议 owner
+
+### Task 2: 先写回归，再替换消息图片区实现
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `web/e2e/chat-ordered-content-blocks.spec.cjs`
+- Modify: `web/src/components/chat/messages/assistant-content-blocks.tsx`
+- Modify: `web/src/components/chat/markdown-text.tsx`
+
+**Step 1: 写失败回归**
+
+- 继续使用 `TC-CHAT-BLOCK-03`
+- 增补断言：canonical `image` block 仍按原比例展示，且不需要经过 Markdown 字符串桥接
+
+**Step 2: 跑红灯**
+
+Run: `eval "$(bash ../scripts/vk_ports.sh --export)" && npx playwright test e2e/chat-ordered-content-blocks.spec.cjs -g "TC-CHAT-BLOCK-03"`
+Expected: 若仍有固定比例/桥接路径残留，测试失败
+
+**Step 3: 最小实现**
+
+- `AssistantContentBlocks` 直接渲染 `ChatImageThumbnail`
+- `MarkdownText` 保留 Markdown `<img>` 解析，但内部复用 `ChatImageThumbnail`
+- 删除消息图区重复的缩略图尺寸逻辑
+
+**Step 4: 跑绿灯**
+
+Run: `eval "$(bash ../scripts/vk_ports.sh --export)" && npx playwright test e2e/chat-ordered-content-blocks.spec.cjs -g "TC-CHAT-BLOCK-03"`
+Expected: PASS
+
+### Task 3: 统一上传预览图片实现
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `web/src/components/chat/MultimodalPreview.tsx`
+- Modify: `web/src/components/chat/ContentBlocksPreview.tsx`
+
+**Step 1: 写失败用例或现有断言补充**
+
+- 若现有 E2E 无上传图片尺寸覆盖，至少补最小组件级/行为级验证，确保预览不裁切图表
+
+**Step 2: 最小实现**
+
+- `MultimodalPreview` 直接复用 `ChatImageThumbnail` 的 `composer-*` preset
+- 删除 `object-cover` 和重复 `ImageLightbox` 状态逻辑
+
+**Step 3: 运行相关验证**
+
+Run: `npx eslint src/components/chat/media/ChatImageThumbnail.tsx src/components/chat/MultimodalPreview.tsx src/components/chat/messages/assistant-content-blocks.tsx src/components/chat/markdown-text.tsx e2e/chat-ordered-content-blocks.spec.cjs`
+Expected: 0 errors
+
+### Task 4: 回归收口
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `web/e2e/chat-ordered-content-blocks.spec.cjs`
+
+**Step 1: 跑聊天图片回归**
+
+Run: `eval "$(bash ../scripts/vk_ports.sh --export)" && npx playwright test e2e/chat-ordered-content-blocks.spec.cjs`
